Momax was present at the holographic meeting called by [[Metz]] to congratulate the Council members on their accomplishments. {{source|Coming of Age}}

Momax was present during the meeting where [[Nasher]] alerted the council that his [[Seekers]] in [[Tower of Nostradamus]] had been attacked by [[the Organization]]. {{Source|The Tower of Nostradamus}}

Momax was later present when [[Focauld Casterwill]] alerted [[Teien Casterwill]] that the [[Blood Spiral]] had found him, a matter Teien brought before the council. {{source|The Casterwill Connection}} Momax was also present when [[Dante]]'s team came before the council to discuss the Blood Spiral and were tasked with the mission [[Call of the Casterwill]]. {{source|The Titan in the Temple of Sun}}

Momax joined the council on the longest night of the year to discuss plans to stop the activation of the [[Spiral Mark]]. {{source|Words from Eathon}} During the final battle at the [[Spiral Mark]], he helped [[Montehue]] defeat [[Wind]] and [[Shakrit]], by utilizing the [[Mjolnir]] Hammer. {{source|Dante's Return}}

Following the defeat of [[The Betrayer]], Momax was seen with the council as they were joined by a new member, [[Dante Vale]]. {{Source|Dante's Return}}
